      "independent_inventory": "Four complete panels A-D. A: increasing convex base-2 curve on x=0..3, half-unit grid, all requested increment intervals inside the window. B: base-2 solid and base-1.5 dashed in one frame, common ordinate at zero and reversed ordering on the two sides. C/D: exponential versus its base-height horizontal line in the increasing/decreasing regimes; crossing aligned with x=1. Axes, rightmost x=3 and final D bottom labels are visible.",
