      "independent_inventory": "One complete E panel. Three separately identifiable decreasing curves: solid third-base, dashed 0.4-base, dotted half-base. All share the same zero-abscissa ordinate. Dashed curve stays between the other two on both sides, with the solid/dotted order reversed. Negative x through -2, positive x through 2, top y=9 and lower/right edge are visible.",
